            {
              "kind": "datasheet",
              "rationale": "MRB3205 34-pin I80 interface, 3.3 V operation with J1 closed, RD and unused chip selects biased high.",
              "reference": "https://www.lcdwiki.com/res/MRB3205/3.2inch_MRB3205_Schematic.pdf"
            },
            {
              "kind": "assumption",
              "rationale": "0.25 mm signal tracks, 0.2 mm clearance and 0.8/0.4 mm vias for a low-cost two-layer prototype. Source33 ohm resistors are fitted on all21 driven signals. 10MHz I80 signal integrity is not proven by routing.",
